From 787d7ae22e7a6362dc94d60e21570cfce1259b09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dragonflylee <dragonflylee@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 13:23:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] vo_libmpv: add libplacebo-based "gpu-next" render backend

Add a "gpu-next" backend for mpv_render_context, selected with the new MPV_RENDER_PARAM_BACKEND (gpu stays the default). It wraps OpenGL and D3D11 targets into pl_tex and drives libplacebo (frame queue, OSD upload, screenshots, hwdec interop, DR buffers). Option and format/crop helpers move to gpu_next/vo_gpu_next.h to be shared with vo_gpu_next.
---
 DOCS/client-api-changes.rst          |    2 +
 include/mpv/render.h                 |    8 +
 meson.build                          |    7 +-
 video/out/gpu_next/context.c         |  255 ++++-
 video/out/gpu_next/libmpv_gpu_next.c | 1416 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 video/out/gpu_next/libmpv_gpu_next.h |   49 +
 video/out/gpu_next/vo_gpu_next.h     |   50 +
 video/out/libmpv.h                   |    1 +
 video/out/vo_gpu_next.c              |   36 +-
 video/out/vo_libmpv.c                |   18 +-
 10 files changed, 1802 insertions(+), 40 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 video/out/gpu_next/libmpv_gpu_next.c
 create mode 100644 video/out/gpu_next/libmpv_gpu_next.h
 create mode 100644 video/out/gpu_next/vo_gpu_next.h

